    {
      "name": "places/ChIJ78zOiLHtaS4RkyMKbowe3H8/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNucU42WTlnRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "The definition of home-style food, the family recipe which are addressed to higher class with combination of great interior. I recommended their Nasi Goreng Kecombrang, Bakwan Jagung, Dendeng Batokok and Latte.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "The definition of home-style food, the family recipe which are addressed to higher class with combination of great interior. I recommended their Nasi Goreng Kecombrang, Bakwan Jagung, Dendeng Batokok and Latte.",
