    {
      "name": "places/ChIJ78zOiLHtaS4RkyMKbowe3H8/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNCdzdubDRnRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 years ago",
      "rating": 4,
      "text": {
        "text": "Loving this cute little place in Rawamangun. And i must say they deserve more that what they currently got. All their food & drinks are just delicious, especially considering their affordability. My favourites are Lumpia, Risol Ragout & Rendang. They do plenty varieties of dishes that you can choose from & create your own rice plate. But they also have rice dishes & noodles too. The place is also cosy and have plenty of seating areas both indoor & outdoor. Don’t forget to stop by if you’re in the area.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Loving this cute little place in Rawamangun. And i must say they deserve more that what they currently got. All their food & drinks are just delicious, especially considering their affordability. My favourites are Lumpia, Risol Ragout & Rendang. They do plenty varieties of dishes that you can choose from & create your own rice plate. But they also have rice dishes & noodles too. The place is also cosy and have plenty of seating areas both indoor & outdoor. Don’t forget to stop by if you’re in the area.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
