    {
      "name": "places/ChIJ78zOiLHtaS4RkyMKbowe3H8/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNoa1lLS3RnRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Kedai Seroja is a hidden gem serving up authentic Indonesian snacks and meals at a great value. From the moment you step inside, you're greeted with a warm and welcoming atmosphere. They served one of the best coffees in Jakarta.\n\nThe menu boasts a variety of Indonesian delicacies, all equally tasty. What's even better is the value for money. The prices are reasonable, especially for the high quality of the food.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Kedai Seroja is a hidden gem serving up authentic Indonesian snacks and meals at a great value. From the moment you step inside, you're greeted with a warm and welcoming atmosphere. They served one of the best coffees in Jakarta.\n\nThe menu boasts a variety of Indonesian delicacies, all equally tasty. What's even better is the value for money. The prices are reasonable, especially for the high quality of the food.",
        "languageCode": "en"
